{"5147050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cognite", "steam_appid": 5147050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Cognite.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an employee of a classified research facility deep underground. Your job is to observe and interact with test subjects — beings that were once human. Each day is a new experiment. Each experiment is a step closer to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But in Cognite, nothing is that simple. Anomalies bleed into reality, monsters break out of their cells, and the days begin to repeat. The choice between life and death is not always the same as the choice between truth and lies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What awaits you:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The atmosphere of a secret bunker, inspired by SCP and time loops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An interactive tablet — your only weapon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is unique — anomalies are generated randomly.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cognite. Welcome to the experiment.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Cognite.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an employee of a classified research facility deep underground. Your job is to observe and interact with test subjects — beings that were once human. Each day is a new experiment. Each experiment is a step closer to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But in Cognite, nothing is that simple. Anomalies bleed into reality, monsters break out of their cells, and the days begin to repeat. The choice between life and death is not always the same as the choice between truth and lies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What awaits you:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The atmosphere of a secret bunker, inspired by SCP and time loops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An interac